grid: return OutOfMemory from AllocTracker::alloc when count * size_of::<T>() overflows. On 32-bit
targets the product wrapped, the request passed the limit, and the following allocation panicked
(capacity overflow). Test: alloc_tracker_size_overflow
(crates/jxl-oxide-tests/tests/alloc_tracker_size_overflow.rs). The input only fails on 32-bit
targets (upstream CI runs the tests on armv7).

Upstream: not reported; the code is unchanged at upstream HEAD (c0cc4c7, 2026-08-15).

diff --git a/crates/jxl-grid/src/alloc_tracker.rs b/crates/jxl-grid/src/alloc_tracker.rs
